(7518607, 1201193, 111808, '<td valign="top">The window is still open and the leaves blow in,<br/>In crisp harmonies bouncing off old walls,<br/>A lonely chair in a corner, cushioned full,<br/>An instrument of polished Art amongst the ruins.<br/>And I can still hear the Music......<br/> <br/> <br/>Beautiful.</td>', 'The window is still open and the leaves blow in,In crisp harmonies bouncing off old walls,A lonely chair in a corner, cushioned full,An instrument of polished Art amongst the ruins.And I can still hear the Music......  Beautiful.', '2017-06-13 23:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
